      "revision": 106358385,
      "text": "キダチトウガラシ は多様性のある様々な栽培品種を含むトウガラシ属の一種。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Capsicum frutescens」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capsicum_frutescens",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1360528221,
      "text": "Capsicum frutescens is a wild chili pepper that has genetic proximity to the cultivated pepper Capsicum chinense. It is native to Central and South America as well as Mexico. Pepper cultivars of C. frutescens can be annual or short-lived perennial plants."
    }
